{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "52e1b64c-dbca-5e72-99b8-10fd9b77be22", "source_ordinal": 218, "reading_ordinal": 3840, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "好猫猫", "published_at": "2026-04-08T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2017585172032271342/answer/2017695461134327949"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "女儿，小学四年级。她在学校有几个交好的好朋友，成绩在班级中上等，运动也可以，整体看比较乖巧的类型。在外人面前有点儿胆小腼腆。她经常不想去上学，尤其周日晚上或者早上出门前，总是焦虑地念叨不想上学。她曾在我送她上学的路上说：“妈妈，我现在就像一个跳伞的人，马上快落地了，但是我的降落伞就是打不开。”快到校门口时，说“我现在离地面只有1米了”。我不是很确定原因，她自己也说不太清楚焦虑担心什么。我跟她聊，还有跟她老师沟通，猜测可能的原因是：她对自己要求过高（想要取得比现在更好的成绩），担心老师批评（其实老师几乎很少批评她，她也尽力避免被批评的可能性），在人群中受拘束（胆小腼腆）想求教：1、怎样搞清楚她不", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 411, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "首先，你的孩子非常聪明。这个降落伞的比喻非常精妙，不知是她原创还是哪里看来的，如果是原创，那么就基本可以排除“不太清楚焦虑什么”这个可能。", "char_start": 412, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "以她这个比喻的功力，洞察自己情绪的能力已经非常高超，她的问题根本不是看不到自己在焦虑什么，而是她的焦虑你们不认可。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "她在焦虑自己的体力、精力、信心不足以支撑自己的野心和你们的期望。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "只是你们不认可。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你们觉得她过于悲观了，觉得她其实还挺轻松的，前景其实还挺乐观。", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你们觉得她把自己的成绩和能力看得太轻了。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "然后就卡死了。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 642}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "她能说啥？说“你们不是我，你们凭啥替我觉得轻松”？", "char_start": 643, "char_end": 668}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "她说了也只能引来新一轮的“你要对自己有信心”。", "char_start": 669, "char_end": 692}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "我没信心了，我拿着铁锹挖这冻土，震得双手生疼，望着一眼望不到尽头的田垄，我觉得我挖不下去了。", "char_start": 693, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "尤其是，我对挖完整块地后到底有多大的快乐和幸福没有那么期待，我不明白我为什么还要继续。", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 783}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "要改变我的悲观、焦虑，要么你们让我体会到某种轻松得多的新挖掘技术，我突然一下挖下了出乎我意料的一大块，这样我再去看这块地就没这么窒息了。", "char_start": 784, "char_end": 852}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "要么，你们要帮助我重塑整个任务列表，向我证明“我现在其实大大的超估了我必须完成的任务量，其实我根本不需要挖这么大块地”。", "char_start": 853, "char_end": 913}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "要么，你们就要帮我重新燃起对任务完成后能得到的幸福的憧憬，让我相信付出一切艰辛、历尽折磨之后会有超出我想象的幸福。", "char_start": 914, "char_end": 971}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这才是你们缓解我焦虑的有效手段。", "char_start": 972, "char_end": 988}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "然而你们在做什么？", "char_start": 989, "char_end": 998}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你们在走“你就是多虑了”“你就是过于悲观了”这条路。", "char_start": 999, "char_end": 1025}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "意味着在上述这几个有效手段方面，你们也没什么后手了，是吗？", "char_start": 1026, "char_end": 1055}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而仅仅这个“原来我的父母也没办法了”的实质表态，就会进一步的增加子女的焦虑。", "char_start": 1056, "char_end": 1094}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "此时子女会下意识的发现不如早点结束对话，以免给其实显然已经没有什么好办法的父母造成无谓的额外压力。", "char_start": 1095, "char_end": 1144}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你们也没办法，我也还没到完全挺不住的时候，就按你们说的，我再坚持坚持吧，何必让你们无谓的多操心呢？", "char_start": 1145, "char_end": 1194}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "她心里把这一圈心思全部走完，自自然然的就回到了“无话可说”的状态。", "char_start": 1195, "char_end": 1228}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "是什么在给她压力？", "char_start": 1229, "char_end": 1238}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "她发现作业不像以前那么好做了，发现自己开始对一些科目没那么强的把握了。", "char_start": 1239, "char_end": 1274}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "发现比自己成绩更好的同学似乎确实就是比自己强，很难追赶。", "char_start": 1275, "char_end": 1303}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "她发现了一系列要重估自己的完工概率的下行趋势。就像一个挖土的人发现随着气温越来越低，土越来越难挖，而原本“三天肯定能搞定”的乐观估计是在气温二十几度时作出的。", "char_start": 1304, "char_end": 1383}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "要是气温低到现在这样就停止下降那也罢了，问题是看上去往后天气还会越来越冷。", "char_start": 1384, "char_end": 1421}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "我能在下雪前完工吗？她没把握了。", "char_start": 1422, "char_end": 1438}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "她那个比喻，几乎完全就是这个意思。", "char_start": 1439, "char_end": 1456}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你觉得她是“对自己要求过高”，问题是她的认知是未来的世界其实只有顶尖的那20%的人能活得有个人样，中等水平毫无意义，照样没有尊严。", "char_start": 1457, "char_end": 1522}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "不是她自己对自己要求高，而是看上去这个世界对人的要求高，不是吗？", "char_start": 1523, "char_end": 1555}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你真正要解的是这个“不爬到塔尖就完了”的心结。", "char_start": 1556, "char_end": 1579}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "而且不能用“你看谁谁没爬到塔尖也活得很好”这个思路，因为这已经等于说“我们也觉得你搞不定”。", "char_start": 1580, "char_end": 1626}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "她对老师的批评敏感、在人群中自我隐藏，就是为了回避进一步的出现悲观信号，你用这个安慰是不行的。", "char_start": 1627, "char_end": 1674}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "目前对你比较安全的临时手段是告诉她几点：", "char_start": 1675, "char_end": 1695}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "1）她会遇到下一个让自己惊喜的成就的，这自自然然就会发生，不需要她做任何额外的特别努力，甚至不需要她保持现在的努力水平，仅仅只需要她继续尽力而为就可以，只需要保持“尽力而为”的状态一段时间，这事就会发生。这就是人成长的一般规律。", "char_start": 1696, "char_end": 1810}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "2）她会找到属于她的顶尖领域，在那根树枝上，她就是那只最大的猫。比她大的猫上不去，比她小的猫打不过。", "char_start": 1811, "char_end": 1861}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "3）找到属于她的那根树枝，不是靠一路战无不胜，而是靠一份独属于她的输赢组合。", "char_start": 1862, "char_end": 1900}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "不仅是因为她赢过的那些，还恰恰是因为她输过的那些，那根树枝才无法属于别人，只能属于她。其他的猫不是因为比她少获得过什么胜利，反而恰恰是因为少经历过几个关键的失败而无法在那根树枝上战胜她。", "char_start": 1901, "char_end": 1994}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "所以不要觉得失败就是坏事，只有不会导致“基因突变”的失败才是坏事。", "char_start": 1995, "char_end": 2028}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "但是必须提醒你——上述所有的劝导都只是战术性的支持。", "char_start": 2029, "char_end": 2055}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "真正釜底抽薪的解决之道，还是要从根上切断“只有优秀才能享福”“活着就是为了尽可能享受”这致命的价值观。", "char_start": 2056, "char_end": 2107}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "人活着是为了尽力创造价值，让其他人因为自己的存在而多少轻松一点，在这个过程中自有应分的享受和传奇。", "char_start": 2108, "char_end": 2157}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "人要甘于和勇于成为伟大而不朽的事业的卑微战士，不是在自身的患得患失中忧惧惊恐，而是要把目光放在能不能带来一点值得欣慰的真正改变上。", "char_start": 2158, "char_end": 2223}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "这才是脱离那永无穷尽的“我不够优秀”的恐惧的根本道路，而不是不断的替她找到新的理由去相信“你还是可以做到足够优秀”。", "char_start": 2224, "char_end": 2282}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "要知道，猫猫也是会老的，难道后半辈子不过了吗？", "char_start": 2283, "char_end": 2306}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 46}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女儿上小学四年级，经常焦虑，说不想上学。我是否该给她请假？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047"], "summary": "围绕“好猫猫”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“女儿，小学四年级。她在学校有几个交好的好朋友，成绩在班级中上等，运动也可以，整体看比较乖巧的类型。在外人面前有点儿胆小腼腆。她经常不想去上学，尤其周日晚上或者早上出门前，总是焦虑地念叨不想上学。她曾在我送她上学的路上说：“妈妈，我现在就像一个跳伞的人，马上快落地了，但是我的降落伞就是打不开。”快到校门口时，说“我现在离地面只有1米了”。我不是很确定原因，她自”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "女儿，小学四年级。她在学校有几个交好的好朋友，成绩在班级中上等，运动也可以，整体看比较乖巧的类型。在外人面前有点儿胆小腼腆。她经常不想去上学，尤其周日晚上或者早上出门前，总是焦虑地念叨不想上学。她曾在我送她上学的路上说：“妈妈，我现在就像一个跳伞的人，马上快落地了，但是我的降落伞就是打不开。”快到校门口时，说“我现在离地面只有1米了”。我不是很确定原因，她自", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 411, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5c70be52-9088-5e90-a8d2-7c811ce4279f", "source_ordinal": 219, "reading_ordinal": 3841, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "理解的谅解", "published_at": "2026-04-08T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1990359973813830354/answer/2017843008024888056"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "我们根本不渴望被理解。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我们渴望的是被接纳，而且是在不理解的前提下的无条件的接纳。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "最好是“我不知道你到底要做什么、到底想要成为什么样的人，但这不重要，总之我坚信你一定是对的，我一定会支持你”。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这才是我们想要的。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 107}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是这个要不到，退而求其次，我们才不得不想办法解释、说服、证明，争取被人理解、在理解的前提下谅解。", "char_start": 108, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "当我们渴望理解时，我们已经输掉了，已经对“得到全心信赖的爱”绝望了，然后才“渴望被理解”。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而之所以比起无条件的爱我们不愿选择基于理解的谅解，就是因为我们不想因为自己耐不住寂寞而不得不忍受一次审判。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "寻求理解就是主动交代，接受判决。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而谅解只是一场没有败诉的审判，一种免于处罚的宽大处理罢了。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果有得选择，谁愿意被人“坦白从宽”一下？", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这就是题设的秘密所在。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 337}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么我们总「渴望被理解」，却又害怕「被看穿」？这背后藏着怎样的心理需求？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“理解的谅解”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我们根本不渴望被理解。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我们根本不渴望被理解。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "aaaccd6e-c894-5631-b921-6c1e74ec4fb9", "source_ordinal": 216, "reading_ordinal": 3842, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "亲爱无比", "published_at": "2026-04-09T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/6d8541302de911f1b86752540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "女儿6岁了，最近和孩子一起养了一只小猫，昨天女儿有点小吃醋地对我说，妈妈为什么你对小猫那么温柔，对我却很严厉呢？我该怎么回答孩子呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为你不是小猫啊。", "char_start": 67, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "“比待遇”这个事，只能对公家，不能对私人。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果是火车上有人抢你的座位但乘警不管，这个你可以提不公平。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但是如果是个人，这个质疑的立场就不存在了，因为个人并不是公家机关，既没有一视同仁的责任，也没有解释的义务。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你问我为什么请客只请张三没请你？你让我从何说起呢？是要逼我告诉你我欠张三一百万，必须求ta宽限一年吗？", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我凭啥告诉你？", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "回头张三又问我为啥约你出去玩不约ta，难道我告诉张三这是我们私交甚笃？", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我又凭啥告诉ta？", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果你是某种“1对100”式的批处理关系中的一员——例如作为我淘宝商店的买家，你来问我待遇对等问题，我也许有答案给你。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但你跟我是私交，是“1对1”关系，我只有一个父亲，一个母亲，一个配偶，一个恩师，一个大儿子，一个二儿子、一个小女儿……", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "结果女儿问我为什么给大哥买篮球不给她买篮球，二儿子问我为什么给妹妹报舞蹈班不给他报武术班。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "答案统一就是“你是你，你不是ta”啊。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 474}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你不是ta，ta也不是你，你的待遇原本就和ta不一样。", "char_start": 475, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你说你在要公平、对等，但为什么你总在要求和ta得到一样的优待，却没有要求和ta吃一样的亏？", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "要不然我们反着操作如何？你羡慕ta，我就取消ta的待遇，让ta和你一样，然后告诉ta是因为你投诉，所以要一碗水端平，这样是不是理论上你也应该满意了？", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 623}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "或者ta羡慕你的待遇，觉得不公，我就把你的待遇取消，还给ta公平，这样你觉得如何？", "char_start": 624, "char_end": 665}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "诶？为什么这样你就不热衷了？", "char_start": 666, "char_end": 680}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "发现了吗？其实你们只是想单边的借着这个“拉平机制”得到更多，由我来不断支付“向上加满”的成本，并不愿意接受我来“向下削平”，用你们的成本来创造“公平”。", "char_start": 681, "char_end": 757}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "更何况，我对你承担的义务其实只有法定的有限责任，而并不理所当然的包含“最惠待遇”这么个东西。", "char_start": 758, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这就像你给我包一盘饺子，市场公允价是12块一盘，只有我没给你12块，你可以叫不公平，我给你12，给张三18，这对你构成不公平吗？", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "仔细想想，这真的有什么公平问题吗？", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这是我损害了你的公平，还是你损害了我的自由？", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "所以，你问我给张三的待遇为什么比给你的好，你就要回答我两个问题—— ", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "第一，我给你的待遇哪里不合法规或者违反了我本来的承诺吗？如果有，那是那个法规和我的承诺兑现的问题，你直接拿那个法规或者承诺请求兑现即可，不要用“怎么不如张三”来做话头。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 1030}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "第二，在满足了承诺和义务的前提下，人有没有偏爱的自由？", "char_start": 1031, "char_end": 1058}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如果不给人偏爱的自由，人要怎么生活？", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1077}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "那不是一碗水端平的问题，而是每两个人之间都有不知多少碗水要端，千手如来都得穿开裆裤——上厕所ta拉链都拉不开。", "char_start": 1078, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "要求一碗水端平，前提是存在这样的明确承诺，比如法庭承诺法律面前人人平等，比如比赛裁判组承诺公平公正公开。", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1186}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "但是你记住——绝大多数人在绝大多数议题上都是没有这个承诺的。", "char_start": 1187, "char_end": 1217}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "没有承诺而索要公平服务，其实对人是很苛刻的。人们往往稀里糊涂搞不明白原因，但这稀里糊涂的结果几乎总是稀里糊涂的对你感到隐隐的反感和愤怒。", "char_start": 1218, "char_end": 1286}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "最后你要到的“公平”往往徒有其表——人家勉强敷衍一下交代了——但是心里埋下的厌恶和愤怒却往往导致你实质的严重损失。", "char_start": 1287, "char_end": 1344}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "得不偿失，明白吗？", "char_start": 1345, "char_end": 1354}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "看明白这整个机制，你要重新建立自己的行为策略。", "char_start": 1355, "char_end": 1378}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "想要什么结果，就去做直接指向这些结果的努力——例如想要得到对方更大的优待，那就多创造对方对你好点的期望收益，创造对方对你不好的期望损失，而不要走“凭什么张三有我没有”这样的“诉讼路线”。", "char_start": 1379, "char_end": 1472}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "因为走这个路线本身就会导致人倾向取消对你的优待、斩断和你的关系。", "char_start": 1473, "char_end": 1505}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你给人讲个笑话都比找人打这种“最惠待遇”官司更有效。", "char_start": 1506, "char_end": 1532}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "牢牢记住这条，时刻绷紧这根弦，你会远比不明白这道理的人更容易得到人的好感和依恋。", "char_start": 1533, "char_end": 1573}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "因为和你来往轻松，简单，和你维持友谊不需要端着十八碗水。", "char_start": 1574, "char_end": 1602}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你朋友多了，自然谁都不敢不给你最惠待遇，张三不给李四会给，下次王五有好机会给你知道了，李四当然比张三先知道。", "char_start": 1603, "char_end": 1657}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "张三自己会知道教训的。", "char_start": 1658, "char_end": 1669}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "这才是谋求最惠待遇的健康做法。", "char_start": 1670, "char_end": 1685}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "不信你试试。", "char_start": 1686, "char_end": 1692}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 45}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：女儿问我「为什么你对小猫那么温柔，对我却很严厉呢」我该怎么回答孩子？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043"], "summary": "围绕“亲爱无比”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“女儿6岁了，最近和孩子一起养了一只小猫，昨天女儿有点小吃醋地对我说，妈妈为什么你对小猫那么温柔，对我却很严厉呢？我该怎么回答孩子呢？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "女儿6岁了，最近和孩子一起养了一只小猫，昨天女儿有点小吃醋地对我说，妈妈为什么你对小猫那么温柔，对我却很严厉呢？我该怎么回答孩子呢？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 66, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9ac138e0-6cd8-5e8f-a262-8a013bb3a0f3", "source_ordinal": 215, "reading_ordinal": 3843, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "委屈", "published_at": "2026-04-10T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/7001151c2ec811f1a6e952540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "委屈不是冤枉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "冤枉，是跟你无关的、对你不了解的人错误的认定你有罪。不是程序有瑕疵、就是证据不真实，但这人还是要硬凭恶意想象来往你身上安罪名。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这触发的首先是愤怒，是斗志，是立刻行动的急切。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 95}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "委屈，是自己敬重、爱戴、信任的人错误的认定自己有罪。", "char_start": 96, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是自己的亲人、同志过于轻率的认定自己有罪。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不是说我有嫌疑不该调查、也不是我有问题不能惩罚，而是这个过程轻率、粗陋的令人心碎。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我以为这么多年，经过了这么多事，你、你们应该对我有基本的了解，有最起码的信心，即使有所怀疑，也会给我足够的机会，即使有了疑点和证据，也会有应分的犹豫和怀疑。谁知道明显的疑点你们无人关心，并不绝对的概率你们已觉得已经无可质疑。", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我没想到，在证据无法确定事实、只剩我的话对抗那些毫无信用、毫无贡献的人的话时，", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你们会让我输。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所以我的心血和生命原来是如此轻微，我的信任和托付，终究只是自作多情。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其实那罪名微不足道，几千块钱、几件失物而已，然而恰恰是这罪的微不足道，更让我恍惚和悲凉。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以，就因为这个，我们就走到尽头了。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人的心会痛，原来不是修辞手法，是真的会揪成一团，紧紧的缩着疼。", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "疼得我脸色煞白，说不出话来。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这是不是传说中的心脏病？", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 506}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "该呼救吗？", "char_start": 507, "char_end": 512}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "我居然有点不想——如此惨败，能不必一遍遍的回想你们这漫不经心的样子，就此离去，也未必不是一件好事。", "char_start": 513, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "当我为此感到惊讶时，我才意识到泪水已经流入了衣襟，染湿了胸口。", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "人言有泪不轻弹，不过未到伤心处。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 611}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "我倒惟愿懵懂无知——若非已经久经沉浮、洞察人心，我何至于如此剜心刺骨的疼呢？", "char_start": 612, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "恰恰是成熟的人，受了委屈伤得深。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你怎么脱困再说，至少这句“为委屈而哭泣是不成熟”拿去丢掉吧。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 698}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "成熟的人受了委屈也会哭泣。", "char_start": 699, "char_end": 712}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我都已经 24 岁了，但遇到事情委屈的时候还是选择哭泣，啥时候才能成熟？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“委屈”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“委屈不是冤枉。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "委屈不是冤枉。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3e5f464c-4eea-584f-b3cc-93ee6ae83fd0", "source_ordinal": 212, "reading_ordinal": 3844, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "拉磨冠军", "published_at": "2026-04-10T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/29149314/answer/2018093146349777804"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "贤妻良母，这都是要有铮铮铁骨才能做得到的境界。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "只有蠢材才会觉得这只需要逆来顺受、忍气吞声。", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 46}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "温柔谦和比狠毒狂暴需要的勇气和能力不知大多少倍，那是极其刚强的表现。", "char_start": 47, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "《生命树》里的张院长就可以算一个例子，你们可以去体会一下这是个多硬核的人。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "谁对张院长龇牙咧嘴，看人打不死ta。", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "认定贤惠只需逆来顺受的，到后来一般都会毒火攻心，态度180度大反转，化身最可怕的怨毒、狠辣之人——而且一般都是在得到“贤妻良母”的公认之前。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "甚至可以这么说——对这个概念最不以为然、最愤恨的，恰恰就是这些以为“贤妻良母就是忍气吞声”、自己这么干了而惨败的人。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "那是一些混账人窃取了这份名望，植入了自己的险恶解读，拿来诱惑你“只有你忍气吞声，我才会发这个奖给你”，然后你上了这些人的当。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这种定义是这些人的定义，这些人拿出一切善良美好的都是这么用。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta们根本不管这些东西自身到底是什么意思，ta们只是需要一张贴纸贴在ta们的塑料奖杯上，好骗人去参加ta们的假比赛。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这些人根本没有资格去定义贤妻良母。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你要去当这些人定义里的贤妻良母也罢、好人也罢、忠臣也罢、义士也罢，一律都会是死路一条。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "贪图这些人的赞誉是会死掉的。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "考虑争夺荣誉之前，先看清楚办比赛的是不是好人。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 523}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "回头ta办个劳模比赛，你得一张纸，ta家一年的面都是你磨的。", "char_start": 524, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "傻不傻？", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 559}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：贤妻良母型的女人已经逐渐被社会淘汰了吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“拉磨冠军”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“贤妻良母，这都是要有铮铮铁骨才能做得到的境界。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "贤妻良母，这都是要有铮铮铁骨才能做得到的境界。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "67fbbce1-f010-5bce-8a2e-838672e2cb17", "source_ordinal": 213, "reading_ordinal": 3845, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "慢反击", "published_at": "2026-04-10T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/9967937857/answer/2018333073415107270"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "假设今天有人突袭我国重要港口，我们会不会等个一个多星期才做出反应？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不会，因为我们有雷达预警系统、有侦察卫星星座可以查明袭击来自何处，有总参谋部、军事委员会和相关部门针对各种可能的情况作出过应对预案，有覆盖全球的打击能力，有足以应对任何挑衅的国力。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这些基础建设缺了任何一样，遇到了侵袭就要先花时间摸清楚自己的底、先做方案、先准备一系列进攻防御的准备，然后才能作出反应。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "任何即刻的迅速反应——例如边防哨兵及时开枪组织就地反击——都是一系列预先准备的结果。哨兵会受到各种情况要按什么程序规范处理的训练，会确保不会造成战略被动。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而所谓的“老实人反应慢”，说白了是因为没有就“如果对方是恶意要如何反击，如果不清楚是不是恶意要如何防患于未然”先做足够的准备。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "临时遇到事了，必须临时想，临时准备。这个准备再怎么快也不是十几秒的事，自然就赶不上趟了。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "要想解决这个问题，几乎必须经历或者深度参与大量的冲突事件。知道这么做会导致什么处理、那么做交警大队、110、市场监督局……法庭会怎么判。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是不能靠所谓“尽情莽”来代替的，只能靠自己踩进麻烦一探虚实，摸清了实际操作中哪些地方是真的严、哪些地方其实可以打擦边球，才能真正有效的快速反应。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这就自然导致在现场比较咄咄逼人的往往会是和公检法司、人事部门缠斗过很多次的人物。ta们比你更清楚事态扩大后的实践后果，经验丰富，准备更足，自然决策更快更坚定。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这是对方在江湖上杀出来的成果，也是挨了不少刀、受了不少怕扛出来的，这个你必须承认。", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 637}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你没经历过，你就没有这个资产，这其实是天然公平的。", "char_start": 638, "char_end": 663}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这也就客观上造成了一个刻板印象——越是反击快而猛得，看上去更放肆的，越是可能有更多的江湖经验，多半不好对付，就像颜色越鲜艳的蛇就越是不好惹。", "char_start": 664, "char_end": 734}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "于是给了“普通蛇”一个新思路——我没毒，也不能打，但我能不能也搞一身对比色，学一学毒蛇的样子，享受下毒蛇的福利？", "char_start": 735, "char_end": 791}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这看上去很诱人，也很痛快，也的确会有很大的概率得手，让一般的对手、包括捕食者优先考虑退让。", "char_start": 792, "char_end": 837}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "怕就怕对方不是一般的对手、一般的捕食者，而是濒临绝望的对手、饥饿边缘的捕食者。", "char_start": 838, "char_end": 877}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人家也没得退让，你有毒人家也要跟你拼一拼了，你可是条假毒蛇，人家一当真，你不是下不来台的问题，你是要变晚餐的。", "char_start": 878, "char_end": 933}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你要掂量清楚。", "char_start": 934, "char_end": 941}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所以这事要看天赐际遇，你是真的经历过，有体会，有准备，敢于博弈的优势你也就不要客气，对方纠结恐惧那是对方的事，你在合理合法范围内利用自己的优势争取利益并没有什么不妥。", "char_start": 942, "char_end": 1025}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但你如果没经历过、没有准备，还是一个“老实人”，那么建议你老老实实、心平气和的接受自己必须要谋定而后动、必然会“不擅长即时反击”的客观现实，就基于这个现实去设计自己的对策。", "char_start": 1026, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "例如你老老实实的回答“你这个做法我不同意，我现在还不确定要具体怎么回应你，我需要时间思考，你不要把我现在暂时的不反应视为默认”。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1177}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你本来就没有义务立刻争回场面，你本来就有权利谋定而后动。尽管快速对攻有利于威慑对方，降低你的成本，但你也不是非要靠这个心理威慑不可。", "char_start": 1178, "char_end": 1244}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "我是老实人，我是没想过你可以这样坏，我是一时拿不定主意要怎么办，但我不投机，不因为拿不定主意具体要怎么办而直接忍气吞声。", "char_start": 1245, "char_end": 1305}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "我暂时没具体计划，不妨碍我告知你我不接受，而且要反击。", "char_start": 1306, "char_end": 1333}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "我告诉完了，我回家问我的亲戚朋友，我去想怎么办。", "char_start": 1334, "char_end": 1358}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你听明白了，你回家去想我有哪些亲戚朋友、去猜我会怎么办。", "char_start": 1359, "char_end": 1387}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "我没纹身、没刀疤、没犯罪经验，但我是不是因此毫无惩罚你的能力，你自己去研究。", "char_start": 1388, "char_end": 1426}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "我敢在毫无计划、毫无经验，而且承认这些事实的前提下先明确表示反对和抗议，你要是觉得毫无威胁，你可以赌一赌。", "char_start": 1427, "char_end": 1480}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "我善于学物理，我自然也善于研究法律。", "char_start": 1481, "char_end": 1499}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "我善于磨毛刺，我自然也善于磨刀。", "char_start": 1500, "char_end": 1516}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "我很勤劳，我不怕这些工作量。", "char_start": 1517, "char_end": 1531}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "我很善良又很可靠，我当然也有我两肋插刀的朋友。", "char_start": 1532, "char_end": 1555}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "我反应慢、嘴笨，不要紧，我们来日方长。", "char_start": 1556, "char_end": 1575}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "我没法用非老实人的方式反抗你，场面上不好看，那我就用老实人不好看的方式跟你对抗。", "char_start": 1576, "char_end": 1616}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "我知道肯定要吃你很多亏，我也要犯很多错误，但是很遗憾，让你毫无成本的这样获取利益对我来说不是小问题，而是一个巨大的问题的开端。", "char_start": 1617, "char_end": 1680}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "抢我五毛钱，严重的不是“五毛钱”而是“抢”，我不是为五毛钱而兴师动众，而是为“抢”不能不坚决出击。", "char_start": 1681, "char_end": 1730}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "我没有巧妙的话术，也没有机智风趣，话就说到这里。", "char_start": 1731, "char_end": 1755}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你要不要改变你的做法，你想好告诉我。", "char_start": 1756, "char_end": 1774}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 37}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么大部分老实人改不掉反应慢的毛病，被欺辱了不会当场反击，只会事后记仇？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037"], "summary": "围绕“慢反击”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“假设今天有人突袭我国重要港口，我们会不会等个一个多星期才做出反应？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "假设今天有人突袭我国重要港口，我们会不会等个一个多星期才做出反应？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d752f922-e348-522a-ac2b-a38ab286c6d7", "source_ordinal": 214, "reading_ordinal": 3846, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "金边", "published_at": "2026-04-10T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/13435572868/answer/2018475665851176231"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "主要是三类：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）表演工作。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "无论是器乐、声乐还是语言类，盲人都有一定的优势。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 39}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一来，盲人的观众缘天然的好。盲人有勇气站上舞台，观众天然的愿意给予鼓励和肯定，这是一个很大的优势。", "char_start": 40, "char_end": 89}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "二来，盲人因为视障的缘故，对外界繁杂信息的骚扰天然免疫力比较强，自然而然的有很多内观、接近禅定的实践，所以对声音里的情绪有比较深的洞察。如果掌握了表达和沟通的能力，比别人更有机会成为可以触摸人心的艺术家。", "char_start": 90, "char_end": 192}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "2）需要敏锐的非视觉感官的工作。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "盲人因为看不见，会导致大脑发育上天然的向其他感官倾斜。听觉敏锐是众所周知的，事实上触觉、嗅觉乃至味觉也都更容易增强。因此可以做调音师、调香师、品酒 / 品茶师。", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 291}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "3）对常人存在更多避讳的身体接触类的工作。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "盲人因为看不见，天然的对某些隐私、避讳免疫，能带给人常人带不来的安全感，因此更适合从事按摩这类的理疗工作。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "其实明星政要很多都喜欢盲人的按摩服务，因为心理上会自然放松一些。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要简单的认为自己的不同只是纯粹的缺陷，多考虑利用积极的一面。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "哪怕是得了癌症，也在另一面意味着有了无敌之身。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 458}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "乌云也有金边，诅咒也含祝福。", "char_start": 459, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "别灰心。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 478}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：视力受限的人适合从事哪些工作呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“金边”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“主要是三类：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "主要是三类：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "689ce568-2d79-5e8b-993e-8671d4d784ec", "source_ordinal": 211, "reading_ordinal": 3847, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "哈哈镜", "published_at": "2026-04-11T01:34:41.312000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/1916738927525623001/answer/2025821526474139246"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "恭喜你，你现在有了一件知人心的利器。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一部分人会嘲笑你、作践你，这不算什么十恶不赦的大罪——人类，尤其是幼崽，天生就有这种习性，算是压制基因变异的一种天然机制——但这部分人估计前途也有限。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "一部分人会憋着难受，如常待你甚至格外优待你，但是时间久了会找你索取补偿——例如赞美和感激。这类人比前一类人略胜一筹。ta们所要的补偿，你可以适当满足，但可一而不可再。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "最后这一类人，会憋着自己的难受，如常待你甚至格外优待你，但无论时间多久，ta们不会找你索要补偿、不认为你欠了什么感激，因为ta们真的自自然然的认为这就是自己的天然义务。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta们对你犯了错，不会自居对你有恩而自我宽免；欠了你的，不会自居对你有惠而自认为可以打折。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 309}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这类人你要死死的盯住，因为这类人前途无量。将来追随ta们、愿意看到ta们成功的人会多如牛毛。", "char_start": 310, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你不就是其中一员？", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而你们——这些不漂亮的、有着这样那样问题和遗憾的——才是人类的大多数。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你长得很美，这个人品、前途探测器可就没了。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 426}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "咋说呢，美貌可以带给你的好处，恐怕没有这个探测器大。", "char_start": 427, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有没有听过“蝇附骥尾，以致千里”？", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 471}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "那是最好的赢法——真躺平。", "char_start": 472, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "而你现在身上就长着能照见千里马的哈哈镜。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 506}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "美不死你。", "char_start": 507, "char_end": 512}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0548"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子觉得自己长得不好看，总是很自卑，如何正确引导她？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“哈哈镜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“恭喜你，你现在有了一件知人心的利器。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "恭喜你，你现在有了一件知人心的利器。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
